{
  "name": "plan-package-v1",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "contract": {
    "purpose": "一份方案（草案/计划/方案文档）在两端的唯一格式。手机与桌面各自本地存储，同一条样例集同时约束两侧实现：任何一侧改了字段、缺省值或拒绝措辞，都会在另一侧的测试里失败。",
    "field_notes": {
      "plan_id": "平台生成；调用方可以显式给定（导入、测试），缺省为 plan_<hex>",
      "revision": "每次被接受的保存 +1；调用方不能指定，只能通过 expected_revision 做乐观并发检查",
      "source": "当前修订由哪一端写入（mobile/desktop）；由主机决定，载荷里的 source 被忽略",
      "project_id": "宿主机本地标识；导出到另一端时由导入方重新指定",
      "execution": "执行信息（会话 id、执行的修订号、开始时间）；未执行时为 null",
      "docs": "文档正文不进这份记录，以项目目录里的真实文件为准；这里只记路径、种类与标题",
      "checklist.steps": "与桌面 write_checklist/update_checklist 的步骤结构逐字段一致（id/description/deliverables/status），执行时可直接装进会话",
      "goal": "与 goal.create 的目标结构一致（objective/completion_criteria），执行时才真正建目标"
    },
    "compared_fields": [
      "schema_version",
      "plan_id",
      "title",
      "status",
      "summary",
      "requirement",
      "open_questions",
      "approach",
      "checklist",
      "goal",
      "risks",
      "docs",
      "execution"
    ],
    "host_local_fields": ["revision", "source", "project_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at"],
    "enums": {
      "status": ["draft", "ready", "executing", "done", "archived"],
      "step_status": ["pending", "in_progress", "completed", "blocked", "skipped", "replaced"],
      "question_status": ["open", "answered"],
      "risk_severity": ["low", "medium", "high"],
      "doc_kind": ["research", "spec", "design", "plan", "tasks", "notes"]
    },
    "status_transitions": {
      "draft": ["ready", "archived"],
      "ready": ["draft", "executing", "archived"],
      "executing": ["done", "archived"],
      "done": ["archived"],
      "archived": []
    },
    "case_shape": {
      "action": "save | revert | delete | restore | list | revisions",
      "given": "先重放的步骤，每项 {action, payload}；action 缺省为 save。用来把方案带到这一步之前的状态",
      "payload": "本步骤的载荷",
      "expect": "ok/error；save 与 revert 用 revision + plan（只比较 compared_fields）或 status；delete/restore/list 用 listed（当前的方案 id 列表）；revisions 用 revisions（[{revision, title}] 升序）"
    },
    "rules": [
      "字符串一律去首尾空白；列表里的空白项直接丢掉。",
      "保存是补丁：方案已存在时，载荷里没出现的字段保持存储值；方案不存在时按新建处理，缺失字段取缺省值。",
      "并发：expected_revision 给了就必须与存储的修订号一致（plan revision conflict: <id>），给了但方案不存在时是 Plan not found: <id>；没给则不做并发检查（界面总会给，模型工具可以不给）。",
      "title 必填：plan title is required",
      "project_id 必填：plan project is required",
      "requirement.restatement 必填：plan requirement is required",
      "approach.chosen 必填：plan approach is required",
      "步骤必须有描述：plan step description is required: <id>；步骤 id 不可重复：duplicate plan step id: <id>；步骤状态非法：invalid plan step status: <status>",
      "文档路径必须是项目内的相对路径（正斜杠、不得以 / 开头、不得含 .. 段）：plan doc path must be relative: <path>；文档种类非法：unknown plan doc kind: <kind>",
      "目标写了任何内容就必须有 objective：plan goal objective is required",
      "风险等级非法：invalid plan risk severity: <severity>",
      "问题必须有内容：plan question is required: <id>；问题状态非法：invalid plan question status: <status>",
      "状态非法：invalid plan status: <status>；非法跃迁：invalid plan status transition: <from> -> <to>（新建时视为从 draft 出发）",
      "定稿（ready）至少要有一步：plan needs at least one step before it is ready",
      "回退：plan.revert 以目标修订号的内容生成一个新的修订（历史只增不改）；目标修订号不存在时：plan revision not found: <id>@<revision>",
      "删除是软删除：列表不再返回，记录与历史都保留，plan.restore 可恢复。",
      "列表顺序：created_at 倒序，created_at 相同时 plan_id 倒序 —— 同一毫秒内连续创建也要得到稳定顺序，不依赖时钟精度。",
      "历史顺序：修订号升序，每个被接受的保存都留一版。",
      "缺省值：summary 空串；checklist.design_summary 空串；question.id 缺省 q<n>、status 缺省 open、answer 空串；step.id 缺省 s<n>、status 缺省 pending；risk.severity 缺省 medium、mitigation 空串；doc.kind 缺省 notes、title 空串；goal 缺省为 {objective: '', completion_criteria: []}。"
    ]
  },
